{"3990870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Replace the Lamp: The Last Shift", "steam_appid": 3990870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU’RE JUST HERE TO REPLACE THE LIGHTS.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE HOUSE WAS NEVER DARK BY ACCIDENT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an <strong>electrician</strong> hired for a simple job:<br>replace the lights in homes and offices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No weapons.<br>No way to fight back.<br>Just your work… and something that moves when the lights go out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOUR DAYS. FOUR LOCATIONS. FOUR INTERTWINED STORIES.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unfolds across <strong>Day 1 to Day 4</strong>.<br>Each day features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a different location</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a unique story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >secrets that were never meant to be uncovered</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shift has <strong>2–3 different endings</strong>, shaped by your actions, your route, and the small decisions you make when you think you’re safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is <strong>linear</strong>.<br>The truth is not.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DO YOUR JOB. DON’T GET CAUGHT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you replace the lights, <strong>something in each location begins hunting you</strong>.<br>You can’t fight it.<br>You can only work, hide, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get caught once, and it’s over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPLAY THE SHIFTS. FIND EVERY ENDING.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing the main story, you unlock the <strong>Day Selector</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >return to any day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >uncover alternate endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >piece together story fragments you missed before</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every ending wants to be found.<br>But all of them matter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple core gameplay: <strong>replace the lights</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semi-realistic visuals with oppressive atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing, tension-driven sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple dark and twisted endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ending progress tracking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A different story every shift</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REMEMBER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not here to save anyone.<br>You’re here to do a job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now,<br><strong>something in the dark knows you’re here.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU’RE JUST HERE TO REPLACE THE LIGHTS.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE HOUSE WAS NEVER DARK BY ACCIDENT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an <strong>electrician</strong> hired for a simple job:<br>replace the lights in homes and offices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No weapons.<br>No way to fight back.<br>Just your work… and something that moves when the lights go out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOUR DAYS. FOUR LOCATIONS. FOUR INTERTWINED STORIES.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unfolds across <strong>Day 1 to Day 4</strong>.<br>Each day features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a different location</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a unique story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >secrets that were never meant to be uncovered</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shift has <strong>2–3 different endings</strong>, shaped by your actions, your route, and the small decisions you make when you think you’re safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is <strong>linear</strong>.<br>The truth is not.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DO YOUR JOB. DON’T GET CAUGHT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you replace the lights, <strong>something in each location begins hunting you</strong>.<br>You can’t fight it.<br>You can only work, hide, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get caught once, and it’s over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPLAY THE SHIFTS. FIND EVERY ENDING.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing the main story, you unlock the <strong>Day Selector</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >return to any day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >uncover alternate endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >piece together story fragments you missed before</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every ending wants to be found.<br>But all of them matter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple core gameplay: <strong>replace the lights</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semi-realistic visuals with oppressive atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing, tension-driven sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple dark and twisted endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ending progress tracking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A different story every shift</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REMEMBER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not here to save anyone.<br>You’re here to do a job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now,<br><strong>something in the dark knows you’re here.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Every light you replace makes the house a little brighter. But something inside prefers to live in the dark. And now, it knows you’re here.", "supported_languages": "English, Indonesian, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990870/16128d1678c4df69aaebb0f840811424fb83b605/header.jpg?t=1767576397", "capsule_image": "https://shared.a